# Smoke 8, SEND, windows: Queue on the open return, in the dry-run test build only (the runner refuses it without --allow-send,
# EBIR_TEST_ENV=1 and BIR_SFTP_DRY_RUN=1). Queue validates first: a return that does not pass Check stops at its to-do.
# (open-2551q-windows.wants already set the profile facts and For-the this return validates against.)
# What validation still wants is in the to-do list and in Part I: capture the list, jump to Part I and answer its
# items (income type goes to the profile inline, exactly what the box says).
click fp-pill-list --screenshot
click fp-nav-attention --screenshot
click 'fp-ask-tax_classification-choices-"SelfEmployed"'
type fp-frm2551Qv2018:telNo 09170000000
click fp-frm2551Qv2018:taxTreaty_2 --screenshot
click fp-queue --screenshot
wait_until queue-continue --timeout-ms 10000 --screenshot
click queue-continue
wait_until fp-cancel-queue --timeout-ms 20000 --screenshot
